3
00:00:03,160 --> 00:00:05,920
Imagine you're a giant ground sloth,

4
00:00:05,920 --> 00:00:07,008
six metres long,

5
00:00:07,008 --> 00:00:08,280
like Megatherium.

6
00:00:08,280 --> 00:00:09,920
Problem one:

7
00:00:09,920 --> 00:00:10,470
food.

8
00:00:10,560 --> 00:00:12,220
So you eat leaves.

9
00:00:12,220 --> 00:00:14,533
But leaves are poor fuel.

10
00:00:14,533 --> 00:00:16,180
So you copy living sloths,

11
00:00:16,180 --> 00:00:17,573
