17
00:00:25,980 --> 00:00:27,910
But you still stand out.

18
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:29,749
So you go green.

19
00:00:29,749 --> 00:00:32,160
Living sloths grow algae in their

20
00:00:32,160 --> 00:00:32,500
