25
00:00:39,933 --> 00:00:42,070
Could that look like backwards feet?

26
00:00:42,240 --> 00:00:44,390
So is one still out there?

27
00:00:44,423 --> 00:00:47,712
Island sloths lasted until four thousand

28
00:00:47,712 --> 00:00:49,110
